O6On      "Op6 on"       0 1    1    switch                          | Operator 6 sounds (off: silent, as on the DX7)
O6Level   "Op6 level"    0 99   0    int 0                           | Output level (carriers: loudness; modulators: brightness)
O6Mode    "Op6 mode"     0 1    0    enum Ratio Fixed                | Ratio: follows the note; Fixed: a fixed frequency
O6Coarse  "Op6 coarse"   0 31   1    int 0                           | Ratio 0.5, 1 … 31 (Fixed: 1, 10, 100, 1000 Hz)
